      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Abdominal pain as a chief complaint can present a significant diagnostic challenge in the primary care setting. It is incumbent upon the primary care provider to have a thorough understanding of the many potential causes of abdominal pain, as well as a methodical, comprehensive, yet concise approach to its assessment."},
